@qiuzhiyei/dsh-companion README · Requirements：- DeepSeek Harness **0.2.x**
- Node.js **22.19+** or **24+**
- Windows / macOS / Linux (the tray and transparent floating window are best under Electron)

@qiuzhiyei/dsh-companion README · Plugin manager (recommended)：DSH → Plugin Manager → Install plugin → enter:

```text
@qiuzhiyei/dsh-companion
```

Then **enable** the plugin and **fully quit and relaunch DSH**.
